  "details": "Currently when we have use pc avatars, but oculus quest users cannot see what we are using, or sometimes we are in a lobby filled with users and we're using un-optimized avatars and suffer performance wise. Well BackUp avatars fit this criteria, a performance mode avatar culled to strict performance optimizations (No Animations, no custom shaders,and below 12k, 1 mesh, limited tracking)\n\nUsers can choose their Fallback avatar to be seen across platforms, even if you are using a different avatar.",
